  intro x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 h5
  rcases lt_or_ge x5 x0 with hlt | hle
  · rcases AMR7Data.cert x5 x4 x3 x2 x1 x0 h5 h4 h3 h2 h1 h0 with h | h
    · rw [← AMR7_G_rev]; exact h
    · exact absurd h (not_lt.mpr hlt.le)
  · rcases AMR7Data.cert x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 h5 with h | h
    · exact h
    · exact absurd h (not_lt.mpr hle)

