from an admissibility witness T ↦ AdmWindow (W T) (L_T) w c (for 8w ≤ L_T) and 1/2 ≤ a eventually,
the fixed-T producers `ZeroSide.blockInputsAt`, `Tail.TailHyp.tailInputs`, `ZeroConfig.Gz_eq_Gp`
